color:#0D1725;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:keep-all;margin-bottom:8px\">“<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">大</span>连和台湾，都<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">是</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">我</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">的</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">家</span>”</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">&quot;Dàlián hé Táiwān, dōu shì wǒ de jiā&quot;</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">&quot;다롄과 타이완, 모두 제 집입니다&quot;</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">我的가 家 앞에 붙어 &#x27;제 집&#x27;이라는 뜻을 만들었습니다</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">我的</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">wǒ de</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">나의, 제</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">家</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">jiā</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">집</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">都</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">dōu</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">모두, 다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">是</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">shì</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">~이다</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day41-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day41-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE13UVZ0R2xiV3RLUlppUmNoeEVZQ1JCeGZCN3BqeGhYWkExN3MtS1dZbzU4SkZvaDRPRVhNNUNxVV9KMjluUTdVY1JvMk9GNVFibzhlZEVnNm9pRGNuQ0wwMkdqeTZVR3lvR0Y4?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">中国台湾网</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">的</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">de</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">~의, ~하는 (앞말을 뒤 명사에 붙이는 조사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">我的</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">wǒ de</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">나의, 제</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">你的</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">nǐ de</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">너의, 당신의</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">老师</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">lǎoshī</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">선생님 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">朋友</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">péngyou</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">친구 (명사)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:30px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">지난 수업</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/?p=2474\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#8C6423;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all\">← 了 언제 붙이나 — 완료와 변화 두 쓰임 (중국어 40일차)</a></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-top:8px\">하루 한 편씩 쌓는 중입니다. 오늘이 41일차입니다. <a href=\"https://daytip.kr/chinese-course/\" style=\"color:#8C6423\">전체 목차 →</a></div>\n</div>\n",
